<p>Glacial fumes rise from the ground, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">41, 55, 66, 75, 83</acronym> cold damage in a radius of 3 each turn for 8 turns.</p><p>Creatures that are wet will take 30% more damage and have 15% chance to get frozen.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>